<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             x:Class="PhotoBook.Shell.Views.StartScreenView"
             FontFamily="Inter">

    <!--
        One step up on this screen, and only this screen.

        The type scale is the product's and stays as it is - 9/10/11/12/14/16/18/20/24 - but a
        screen that is nothing but paragraphs is read at a glance rather than studied, and at
        twelve pixels Inter reads thin. The body goes to thirteen here and the two names to
        nineteen; the headings are already large enough that moving them would only make the
        page taller.

        It is written here, in the view, rather than in Typography.axaml on purpose. The same
        twelve-pixel body is right in a dialog where the words are two lines long, and a
        scale that moves for one screen stops being a scale. These two rules sit closer to
        their controls than the shared ones do, so they win on this screen only.
    -->
    <UserControl.Styles>
        <Style Selector="TextBlock.t12">
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13" />
        </Style>
    </UserControl.Styles>

    <!--
        Transcribed from doc\DESIGN_SPEC.md section 4, number by number, and checked against
        the other shell's markup for the places where the two differ on purpose.

            container     max 1200, margin 32/16, blocks 32 apart
            heading       20 bold, centred, brand
            subtitle      12 slate-500, wraps at 560
            grid          two equal columns, gap 24
            mode card     padding 24, 1px slate-200, radius 16, shadow, brand frame on hover
            tile + name   48x48 tile radius 16 beside the name, glyph 20, row 20 below
            mode name     19 bold
            description   12 slate-600, line height 19
            feature list  20 above, 10 between, check 12, text 8 across
            card footer   rule inside the card, 32 above it, 12 semibold in the mode's colour

        There is one heading on this screen and it is twenty pixels, not the twenty-four of
        the original: there is nothing else at that size on the page now, and the cards carry
        the detail. The copy above them is that heading and one line. Both are departures,
        listed with the others below.

        Four departures, each recorded rather than quietly copied:

        1. The card is a Button, not a Border that reacts to a mouse press. A control that
           only answers a mouse cannot be reached from the keyboard and does not appear in
           the automation tree, and this screen is two choices - it is the one place where
           that matters most. Everything the card shows, footer included, is its content, so
           the rule and the call to action stay inside the frame where they belong.
        2. Hover is a pointerover rule, not an IsMouseOver trigger. Same result, and it
           needs no code-behind to keep working.
        3. The badge is a rounded rectangle here as it is in the other shell. The design
           called for a pill; the pill outline read as a stray border rather than a label,
           and one shape in a product should belong to one thing.
        4. The two cards share one grid row, so they are the same height. Laying them out as
           a horizontal stack gives each card only as much height as its own text, and the
           two cards on this screen are not the same length - the combined one carries an
           extra highlighted box. Equal heights are what the frame is for: a row of cards
           of different heights reads as a mistake whichever engine drew it.
        5. The container is 1200 wide, not the 896 of the released program. At 896 each card
           was 430 and its text wrapped into six or seven lines, so the cards came out 535
           tall and the page wanted a vertical scrollbar on a screen with room to spare -
           which reads as "there is more below" where there is nothing more below. At 1200 the
           cards are 580, the tallest text is four lines, the cards are 450 tall, and the whole
           screen fits with room over at 1520x800 and again at 1280x800. The scrollbar is still
           there and still automatic: at 1000x640 the content runs past the bottom and the page
           scrolls. Wider than this and the lines are too long to read comfortably.
        6. The tile sits beside the name rather than above it, and the name is 19 rather
           than 18. Stacked, with twenty of air between them, the two read as two headings:
           a picture with a caption, then a title, then a paragraph. Beside each other the
           tile is a mark for the name it belongs to, and the row is as tall as the tile, so
           nothing below it moved.
        7. The 24-pixel heading is gone and what is above the cards is one line of twenty
           bold in the brand colour, and one line of text under it. The heading said "two ways
           to make photo books", which is what the two cards underneath were already saying,
           and the line under it went on to explain what a mode is - on a screen whose entire
           content is two choices. It also said a mode could be changed later by opening a
           project made in the other mode. There is no such thing anywhere in the program: a
           project keeps the mode it was made in, and nothing offers to change it. So the
           copy above now says what the choice is and the one fact that decides it - it is
           made once.

           The line was a chip first: a violet rounded rectangle around twelve-pixel
           semibold words, drawn the way the mode badges are drawn, which made the one line
           that names the screen look like a badge sitting on a card. It is the heading of
           this screen, so it is a heading: twenty bold in the brand colour, and the chip
           gone - at that size the chip would have read as a button.
    -->
    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
        <StackPanel MaxWidth="1200" Margin="32,16,32,32" HorizontalAlignment="Center">

            <!-- ============================== heading ============================== -->
            <StackPanel>
                <!--
                    The heading of the screen, and not a label above one. It was a chip:
                    a violet rounded rectangle around twelve-pixel semibold words, the way
                    the mode badges are drawn - which made the one line that names the
                    screen look like a badge on a card. At twenty bold, with the chip gone
                    and the brand colour kept in the words, it reads as what it is, and the
                    eye has something to land on before the cards.
                -->
                <TextBlock Text="Выберите режим создания проекта"
                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand600}" />

                <TextBlock Classes="t12" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextAlignment="Center"
                           TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="560" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate500}"
                           Text="Выбранный режим определяет формат работы с книгами. Режим выбирается один раз при создании проекта" />
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- A fixed 24-wide spacer column rather than a spacing property: this engine's grid has
                no ColumnSpacing, and a spacer is the same 24 with nothing left to get wrong. -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,24,*" Margin="0,32,0,0">

                <!-- ======================== уникальные папки ========================= -->
                <Button x:Name="UniqueCard" Classes="modeCard"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Уникальные папки"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <Grid RowDefinitions="*,Auto">

                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0">
                            <!--
                                The tile and the name on one line.

                                Stacked, the tile sat above the name with a full 20 of air
                                between them, and the card read as two headings: a picture
                                with a caption under it, then a second heading, then a third
                                block of text. Beside each other, the tile is a mark for the
                                name it belongs to, the way a mark is anywhere else in the
                                product - and the row is as tall as the tile, so nothing
                                after it moves by a pixel.
                            -->
                            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,20">
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Width="48" Height="48" CornerRadius="16"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource Sky50}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE8C0;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="20" Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky600}"
                                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                </Border>

                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="Уникальные папки"
                                           FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold"
                                           Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate900}" />
                            </Grid>

                            <TextBlock Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                                       LineHeight="19" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                       Text="Каждая загруженная папка становится отдельной фотокнигой. Программа сама определит обложку, разложит фотографии по разворотам и присвоит файлам имена, готовые к загрузке." />

                            <StackPanel Margin="0,20,0,0">
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Обложка определяется сама: самое большое фото в папке" />
                                </Grid>
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Порядок разворотов можно изменить, если фотографии в папке идут не по сюжету" />
                                </Grid>
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="В одном проекте можно загружать только папки с одинаковым количеством файлов — это нужно для правильной сборки книг" />
                                </Grid>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!--
                            The rule and the call to action live inside the frame, on its own
                            bottom edge. The body row above takes the slack, so this sits in
                            the same place on both cards however many lines the text takes.
                        -->
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,32,0,0">
                            <Border Height="1" Background="{DynamicResource Slate100}" />
                            <Grid Margin="0,16,0,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Выбрать режим" Classes="t12Semi"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky600}" />
                                <TextBlock Text="&#xE72A;" HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                           FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" FontSize="12"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Sky600}" />
                            </Grid>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Grid>
                </Button>

                <!-- ========================= комбинированный ========================= -->
                <Button x:Name="CombinedCard" Classes="modeCard" Grid.Column="2"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Комбинированный"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <Grid RowDefinitions="*,Auto">

                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0">
                            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,20">
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Width="48" Height="48" CornerRadius="16"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource Brand50}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="&#xE8F1;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="20" Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand600}"
                                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                </Border>

                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="Комбинированный"
                                           FontSize="19" FontWeight="Bold"
                                           Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate900}" />
                            </Grid>

                            <TextBlock Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                                       LineHeight="19" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                       Text="Режим для сборки книг вручную: вы выбираете, какое фото в какой книге и на каком развороте будет стоять. Подходит, когда состав каждой книги подбирают отдельно." />

                            <!--
                                The point of the mode, in one sentence. A shared spread is what
                                makes a run of forty books bearable, and it is the one thing
                                this mode does that the folders mode cannot.
                            -->
                            <Border Background="{DynamicResource Brand50}"
                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brand100}" BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="10" Padding="12,10" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Главное — общие развороты и обложки"
                                               Classes="t12Semi" Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand700}" />
                                    <TextBlock Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"
                                               LineHeight="18" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Одинаковый разворот или обложку можно добавить сразу во все книги одним действием — и больше не заполнять его вручную в каждой. На больших заказах это заметно ускоряет сборку." />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <StackPanel Margin="0,20,0,0">
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Любая фотография попадает в любую книгу и на любой разворот" />
                                </Grid>
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Общий разворот или обложка добавляется сразу во все книги одним действием" />
                                </Grid>
                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="&#xE73E;" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand500}" />
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Classes="t12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Margin="8,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate600}"
                                               Text="Количество разворотов у всех книг одинаковое — это нужно для правильной сборки" />
                                </Grid>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,32,0,0">
                            <Border Height="1" Background="{DynamicResource Slate100}" />
                            <Grid Margin="0,16,0,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Выбрать режим" Classes="t12Semi"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand600}" />
                                <TextBlock Text="&#xE72A;" HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                           FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets" FontSize="12"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brand600}" />
                            </Grid>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Grid>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <TextBlock Classes="t12" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextAlignment="Center"
                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,32,0,0"
                       Foreground="{DynamicResource Slate500}"
                       Text="Выбранный режим откроется в отдельной вкладке и будет доступен, пока проект открыт." />
        </StackPanel>
    </ScrollViewer>
</UserControl>
